  <item>
    <title>07.日式无常：樱花易落，富士不语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68addbe442cc2798e78edc0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68addbe442cc2798e78edc0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 16:50:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们在樱花季去了日本，在富士山下骑自行车、荡秋千。东京郊区的公园里，看樱花树下游戏的孩子。跟上班族一起在地铁站排看不见尽头的长队，在站台上狂奔。儿童乐园的夜樱下，不良少年和谈恋爱的小情侣，让我们仿佛走进了日剧的世界。</span></p><p><span>作为日本美学缩影的富士山，美在哪里？樱花为什么是物哀美学的代表？日本美学神神叨叨的？侘寂、幽玄、物哀到底在讲什么。一切围绕“无常”展开。</span></p><p><span>美的消逝即是美本身，不如拥抱浮世，享受刹那。</span></p><p><span>日本，真的好“日本”。欢迎订阅我们，和我们一起小跑离开。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 看山开端之昏迷的33</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a> 富士洄游号历险记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 河口湖之《甲州三坂水面》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 富士山美好时刻</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwQEHMFDtkvosOAtdRtgeX355yg.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlES0iPJnZ8JokqxpDw11e-HP-pO.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqYf3Gv5tj-A-9bI11vD6FhlGj9R.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a> 富士山美在哪里？是无常</span></p><ul><li><p><span>出发</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6uV5iH0M5GqF1nYfrQZU4uPyPF.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>回程</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrCb6ANFr5FIEDqcUJ4rFgvxUvaX.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> 侘寂、幽玄、物哀，日本美学也没那么玄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 樱花大作战：逃离都市，去郊区赏樱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 平凡又美好的砧公园一天</span></p><ul><li><p><span>参天大樱花树</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsMBTFYRdFcveesl_1njtjH4n4y1.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>树与树孰美？</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs5cGe27LbpDFZ8B_NZRhj2_kvN9.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>治愈时刻</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrG8ho2ovxf7UuCOgn_N7xMeceVF.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs3iUqi7uY6ZgLEEfOkykatwCGoz.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> 日剧的世界禁止写真</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a> 这个多佛多神的国度，宗教融合重叠而不排他--神佛习合浅草寺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3368">56:08</a> 这次真是🗼东京塔</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-ASzrkmB7JdR-DP1k2t8Wju1So.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqce_PaGEU22pBw6fMeUeENBuTHh.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3699">61:39</a> 现代浮世绘，新宿歌舞伎町</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3906">65:06</a> 步行者的天国！银座</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4178">69:38</a> 跟着蜡笔小新去吃饭之天价蟹腿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4571">76:11</a> 周女士觉得最好吃的东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4718">78:38</a> 常规节目： 如厕测评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4914">81:54</a> 什么地铁让周女士如此害怕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5312">88:32</a> 环保？真的假的！拖鞋噩梦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5466">91:06</a> 总要把均价打下来吧</span></p><p><span>谢谢你看到这里，别忘了订阅我们 💜</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6740579211045e78e5181b14/lqMqrfmiUCEriiLauOg59m3y-Qr7.m4a" length="92000817" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZ4uUyZqB_qWSTRTvemeOXXKLM6.png"/>
