  </item>
  <item>
    <title>05.流动的盛宴：巴黎你好，再见呀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e19aeb78103db3bda96698</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e19aeb78103db3bda96698</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Mar 2025 20:11:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是两个设计师的巴黎之旅，艺术成分超标。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在卢浮宫，奥塞，橘园之间穿梭，看达芬奇，梵高，莫奈。随着雨果的灵魂在巴黎圣母院前飘荡，最后落在先贤祠长眠。在雨后的塞纳河中游船，看埃菲尔铁塔被夕阳染成红色。</span></p><span></span><p><span>海明威年轻时旅居巴黎，曾这样形容它，“假如你有幸年轻时在巴黎生活过，那么你此后一生中不论去到哪里她都与你同在，因为巴黎是一席流动的盛宴”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次行程，P人33无脑发送参考清单，J人周女士一言不发严格执行，我们会怎么度过我们的巴黎之旅呢？反正回来之后跟博物馆隔离了一段时间吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅我们，跟我们一起享用盛宴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 第三次来到巴黎的周女士，新鲜体验之塞纳河游船</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8w-L_4uhAhmqKW2MNn31gZAthG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 神来的一笔，巴黎圣母院的歌声时刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrezvHmtpIjXEYZhKFXgq2fwv3wi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> 先贤祠的灵魂们啊，赐我一点灵光吧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr_sZe9NQb2QIjBuvLFSB-b3Ysk8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8URBM4MwFPI5-cZW8tgW91e_dV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 是谁灰头土脸的去了极尽奢华的巴黎歌剧院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljnUaAwrjP-2zajGgNanU0QQ1aVW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> 全世界最著名的博物馆--卢浮宫</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>神秘被盗的《蒙娜丽莎》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrrhVWytUw_zhWFoF2B2KVkNvdwb.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《加纳的婚礼》中，沦为配角的一对新人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luO1RKPiaOWi4B4W3ww_lREk6TtA.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在《胜利女神》下，与22岁的自己擦肩而过</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk3KkKLIQwovlilWPqgWPFt0DXeM.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>午后澡堂里的《米洛的维纳斯》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEl04zl9W1BrZ5c2NMQFcWsZiZi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> 开满莫奈睡莲的橘园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr1RbnglVeshWyaP-_OWs820aBGR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2gE4O7_x2SyVjxDjDgrju7yPk6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltOW8VQ1Ahr2CRFFCDj3liIRY6UH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> 奥赛里的连环故事会</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《罗讷河上的星夜》与塞纳河上的灯夜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhRRlBjrlwVZ7NfBL15NsISONROG.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《奥林匹亚》与《草地上的午餐》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnpJsXhI5M8iFODD10VIqSS9Yq-2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3996">66:36</a> &nbsp;大事情！如何解决巴黎的如厕问题</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkrKMqX1_2zofx5YfhN_K8UAlJWZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4281">71:21</a> 到底是谁“搭乘着世界上最混乱肮脏的地铁轨道之一，我对这座城市一见钟情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4517">75:17</a> 盗亦有道？全方位防盗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4768">79:28</a> 按快门前，思考延长</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTwrHuenzEgyhT73zOeTGijHRix.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvSeavBx6UTWVhO6r1CF0LsBBza8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5105">85:05</a> 今天和昨天不一样，出来混先出去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5252">87:32</a> 法语的“再见”怎么说？《Bonjour Au revoir》</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢你们看到这里，再见呀 💗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6740579211045e78e5181b14/lgpKtEpuLaLuD8HuhnzLw9Q5pIQw.m4a" length="85681149" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:17</itunes:duration>
