  <item>
    <title>04.新春走亲戚：小时候在手里炸开的炮仗，到现在还在响</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67926e61247d51713ce832e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67926e61247d51713ce832e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jan 2025 22:18:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小说有摆脱不掉的反派，春节也一定有讨厌的亲戚出场。过年三件套：亲戚、催婚、你工资多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有“一个阶段该做一个阶段的事”这样的事。在宇宙的维度里，我们也是小虫，可以选择不生蛋的，飞到山那边去看看夕阳。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 童年记忆《大拇指公主》片尾曲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDiCD4-hNzviiMybf_g9-GCVAqq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 炮仗教会我的那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 仙人掌女士带来的年味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 异国他乡，暖气片上烤馄炖皮包饺子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 一些讨厌的亲戚，和一些讨厌的亲戚说一些讨厌的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 结婚有什么好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 《大拇指公主》，宇宙的虫子想去山那边看看夕阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 已读乱回，工资你说多少是多少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> 父母养老，身体健康很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3409">56:49</a> 如果你可以制定一个过年习俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3539">58:59</a> 听到这里会有惊喜 🥳</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅我们，和我们一起小跑离开，去当一个自己小时候喜欢的大人吧 💗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6740579211045e78e5181b14/lsqLxh1lRj5HGj-g8S5jj-39ug5b.m4a" length="57749330" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmqsOjkkAYgxr0fHBY-MtgziHwHJ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03.走进不科学：跨年夜，我们从禅修的寺庙逃跑了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67715c541e823e72d3ad8476</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67715c541e823e72d3ad8476</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Dec 2024 19:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>无神论者在烧香，有神论者却不拜佛。佛教居然是无神论，那人们到底在拜什么。“禅修”在修什么，让乔布斯、马斯克、马云都着迷的“正念”跟它又有什么关系呢。欢迎大家订阅我们，和我们一起，走进不科学。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 用洛阳铲铲一下33的歌单，《生活倒影》正好就在去禅修那天的切面上。山脚一颗大树充满生机，每一片树叶似乎都在冒着闪闪发光的氧气泡泡。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 禅修、冥想和正念之间到底是什么关系</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 菩萨为我们关上了一道门</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 佛教是无神论？那人们在拜什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a>寺庙禅修到底在修什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 饭前要唱歌？周女士的地狱斋饭，33的美味天堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a>寺庙，怎么不是一个社会呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">50:13</a> 尼姑庵里的“师兄”和“先生”，“男身”与“女身”&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3572">59:32</a> 逃跑过程全记录</span></p><p><span>感谢收听，欢迎订阅我们，和我们一起，小跑离开。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrs6BTSVE8mkF8pmo6l6yzWdrd9f.m4a" length="66100487" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvG9lQlIhTHlMCDBG-dgWgI3IpJD.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02.出埃及记（下）：女性如同困兽，骗子和我们一起在信任的世界里崩塌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6746ece78d1233fb0d80abb6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6746ece78d1233fb0d80abb6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 11:32:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>都说埃及的骗子多，真的是这样吗？困兽的牢笼谁去打破，骗子的终点又在哪里。埃及，真是一个完全意想不到的世界。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>如果你问我们，埃及是不是值得？那就听到最后吧。</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头是阿斯旺酒店的音乐表演，非常有感染力</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnEJP2ucb2daG429RZpUCWop6jaJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 闯入镜头的镜头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljTW6OiMBT2sCpc5zKB6tGavNoPL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 格子间里的女人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsmF97TsBv9AMC3P2FiRPgfk7FMb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 金字塔典型骗局之马车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnr-5Pp7O4_G7_SyebAzXXnPZFa_.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>周女士在金字塔内部拉练👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvGy4LwU28cx2pwnEziVMXlkfI83.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2117">35:17</a> 帝王谷摄影大师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj9rWkBFSe1rqsWCYUY6GPJ5GDEm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>色彩艳丽的帝王谷壁画👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg73HimTL1KpL9zeHVn21A4sHzxe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> 站在门外刁钻角度拍到的黄金面具</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgtpYF4bpWVcVOXzV5-xO5a8OQ7o.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>埃及博物馆一角👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljveWvD-LBPxqiTirsXs1IrSKdD6.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2797">46:37</a> 卡纳克神庙没有座儿高的33</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiepKo8awrfReyvoVg7_LNbfBgbr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎订阅，谢谢收听和观看💗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmAPOJeOuFtaC_EFshGtmqdJUmrq.m4a" length="62497459" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiO7fN7TdGh93v_Ts4eSEJhs9tzI.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01.出埃及记（上）：戏剧张力拉满的红海与尼罗河上的日落</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6741a9ff11045e78e549632d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6741a9ff11045e78e549632d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Nov 2024 10:30:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们刚刚完成了为期十天的埃及之旅，从最北端的开罗，跳跃到最南端的阿斯旺，再一路包车北上，途径卢克索，停留赫尔格达，最后返回开罗。在这一路上我们遇到了很多意想不到的状况，颠覆了很多认知，看到了很多新鲜事，不得不说，埃及，后劲实在是太大了。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 海豚出现啦</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVnFhdmbZ0VQhth9MvBF4RxN-s3.JPG"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 首次浮潜的33，勇闯红海</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loihKlbjDLgNhJ10JNJn7fw_YW3u.JPG"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 尼罗河上的船夫</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoyXroEW7ayIostHzvVC3HyOsxu4.JPG"></figure><p><span>细心的朋友可能发现33的手里拿了一个胶片相机，时隔一年它终于洗出来啦。发现一直有朋友在听这期节目，所以悄悄在这里更新一下 📷</span></p><ul><li><p><span>金字塔</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulGPwps1R8PQSD65euaZUNBKI2T.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>阿布辛贝神庙</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljmXkBGfI8XFW-exODO0Ipp0KZtI.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luGTXKs58rzKDZLyWfhzVZC3ki9_.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>卢克索热气球</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lms0flAuVutIss8HMklkxGhXCSzK.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lub118bXkC0vNjuXBj0i60TZySiz.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>卡纳克神庙</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltlwEu1AZAGPPtKe4LiS14NHlQCc.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln0q0E5dGXY8BJlNf7VDt0hBYJ1d.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>赫尔格达海边</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvzRMo7zRdlM4wsgOgVrl66hnPFJ.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>开罗哈里里市场</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luB3oK9Q4c4t61B444B2lKSEnq9Y.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>在开罗的车上，赶往机场。“要胶片按完”拍下的，但我很喜欢。</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltijYgFRpLtW9cAkIK5gf_IAQaKE.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>开罗现代化的一面，在尼罗河畔的酒店阳台</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llgBFemrk9vsGWfuj6fbIgXbKho7.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>开罗塔</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liQ_51YZEY_PbTPph2iot7q_GcPS.jpg"></figure><p><span>谢谢你看到这里，订阅我们吧，和我们一起小跑离开 💜</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq1OGD_Aa9D-0P7CYuvBYtJMsyfH.m4a" length="52554316" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiKNicZ8ED7jbLKJKhSvWsE2eqU9.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
